Dear Ingrid,

These warnigns mean that there are 9 genes in which a few data points
are substantially influential to the regression model. These could be
outliers and therefore it is recommended to look in more detail into
these genes and remove from the analysis if necessary. You can find
these genes under the slot influ.info. of the T.fit object.

Best regards

