SpotType	ID	Name	Color
Gene	*	*	black
QC	*	QC*	orange
Control	*	Cntrl*	brown
Empty	*	empty	purple
NegCtrl	*	NC*	pink

which shows my Controls, whose ID begins with Cntrl, as brown etc.

